<title>CHINA: Trading in Nority shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Nority shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Nority International Group Ltd was suspended in the afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the sport shoe maker were unchanged at HK$1.36 at midday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
